<StaticPage title="Wine To Water" heading="Wine To Water community impact" intro="For every refrigerator filter purchased, Filters Fast donates a portion of the sale directly to Wine To Water." description="Filters Fast has partnered with Wine To Water since 2011, donating a portion of every refrigerator filter sale to bring clean water to communities worldwide.">
  <a href="https://www.wtw.org" rel="noopener" target="_blank" class="float-right ml-6 mb-4 w-48"><img src="/pages/wtw-logo.png" alt="Wine To Water" class="w-full" loading="lazy" /></a>
  <p class="text-ink">Our partnership with Wine To Water began in 2011 and continues to this day. For every refrigerator filter purchased, Filters Fast donates a portion of each sale directly to Wine To Water.</p>
  <p class="mt-4 text-lg font-semibold italic text-brand-blue">Water is just the beginning.</p>
  <p class="mt-4 text-ink">Wine To Water is a non-profit organization committed to supporting life and dignity for all through the power of clean water. Wine To Water has brought clean water access to over 1.6 million people and counting in 50 different countries. What sets Wine To Water apart is its focus on sustainability and transformation in the communities it works in: in addition to working hand in hand with local partners to build and repair water systems, it trains community members to maintain them for the long term.</p>
  <p class="mt-6"><a href="https://www.wtw.org" rel="noopener" target="_blank" class="btn-primary">Learn More About Wine To Water</a></p>
</StaticPage>
